    <string name="arena_plan_rush">Fast pressure and weakened targets. Recovery is saved for keeping the attack going.</string>
    <string name="arena_plan_tactical">Balances pressure with energy reserves and looks for vulnerable opponents.</string>
    <string name="arena_plan_ranged">Favors distance and ranged techniques, then changes strategy as HP and energy fall.</string>
    <string name="arena_plan_guard">Defensive positioning, stronger counterattack chances, and careful recovery.</string>
    <string name="arena_plan_support">Supports the team and starts recovery earlier to protect an endangered partner.</string>
    <string name="arena_plan_control">Status control and conservative energy use, with specials held for useful openings.</string>
    <string name="arena_plan_balanced">Adapts positioning and strategy to the current targets, HP, and energy.</string>
